Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-ch8v-r6jh-4vvr: FILTER_SANITIZE_ENCODED leaves 0xFF
 to stack garbage

php_filter_encode_url() filled its 256-entry "must encode" table with
memset(tmp, 1, sizeof(tmp) - 1), so the entry for 0xFF was uninitialised
and whether that byte got percent-encoded depended on the stack. The whole
table is now initialised.

Backport of php-src 7ac9700d0d (Ilia Alshanetsky), same change as Sury's
5.6 patch 0301.

