Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-m33r-qmcv-p97q (CVE-2026-7261): SoapServer
 use-after-free with SOAP_PERSISTENCE_SESSION

When parsing a SOAP header failed, a SoapServer with session persistence
freed the service object stored in the session and kept using it.

Backport of php-src db2a7f9348 (Ilija Tovilo), same change as Sury's 5.6
patch 0252, and the test part of 0370 (SKIPIF instead of
--EXTENSIONS--).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
